 controllable novelty" claim that does NOT report the no-novelty-bonus AND the
 cosmetic-novelty (controllability-gate-off) ablations + offline_reproduced is
 flagged (it may be a flat-exploration win mislabeled, or the controllability
 gate added nothing); (2) PROPOSAL-FILTER-WITHOUT-HELDOUT-REJECTION -- a
 program-synthesis action-effect coverage claim that does NOT report the
 held-out rejected-program count + the matched blind-proposal baseline is
 flagged (the experts_overfit_prefix guard). Honest artifacts NOT flagged.
 Tests green.

